  "Description": {
    "Cost": 3958209,
    "UIName": "Kingfisher",
    "Id": "chassisdef_kingfisher_KNF-F",
    "Name": "Kingfisher",
    "Details": "One of the earliest second generation OmniMech designs, the Kingfisher debuted in 2887 and is reputed to have influenced all subsequent Clan Assault OmniMech designs. A 90-ton mech powered by a 360-rated Fusion Engine, the Kingfisher has 24 tons of podspace provided by a combination of Ferro-Fibrous armor and an Endo Steel skeleton. The Kingfisher F is armed with a HAG/30 and an ER Large Laser. At closer ranges, the F can bring to bear a trio of ER Medium Lasers.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Rugged</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.17</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
